<title>UK: Deutsche Bau-Und Bodenbank sets 150 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau-Und Bodenbank sets 150 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU- UND BODENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY    03.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 02.DEC.97 WHEN THE BOND IS CALLABLE , THEN</p>
<p>		STEPS-UP ANNUALLY TO 4.50 PCT,</p>
<p>		5.0 PCT, 6.0 PCT AND 6.50 PCT.</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	=DECKUNGSSTOCKFAEHIGKEIT . IHS SERIES 41</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
